+The command prints the sales summary (one row per SKU) as CSV by default.
+Use `--format json` to print the same summary as JSON. JSON output follows
+`json.dumps(obj, indent=2, sort_keys=True)` with a trailing newline; money
+values remain integer cents. CSV output and JSON formatting follow
+docs/CONVENTIONS.md. The command exits 0 on success.
